   316	===== 12 =====
   317	>n
   318	
   319	North of House
   320	
   321	You are facing the north side of a white house. There is no door here, and all
   322	the windows are boarded up. To the north a narrow path winds through the trees.
   323	>n
   324	
   325	Forest Path
   326	
   327	This is a path winding through a dimly lit forest. The path heads north-south
   328	here. One particularly large tree with some low branches stands at the edge of
   329	the path.
   330	
   331	>u
   332	
   333	Up a Tree
   334	
   335	You are about 10 feet above the ground nestled among some large branches. The
   336	nearest branch above you is above your reach.
   337	
   338	Beside you on the branch is a small bird’s nest.
   339	
   340	In the bird’s nest is a large egg encrusted with precious jewels, apparently
   341	scavenged by a childless songbird. The egg is covered with fine gold inlay,
   342	and ornamented in lapis lazuli and mother-of-pearl. Unlike most eggs, this one
   343	is hinged and closed with a delicate looking clasp. The egg appears extremely
   344	fragile.
   345	
   346	>
